  "slug": "whiskey-fig-sour-recipe-12034722",
  "name": "Whiskey-Fig Sour",
  "recipe_type": "dessert",
  "brief_description": "Give figs a quick simmer and steep on the stovetop to create an intensely sweet simple syrup. Paired with cherry liqueur, it transforms a classic rye whiskey sour into a smooth, jammy-tart cocktail.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Fill a cocktail shaker half-full with ice. Add whiskey, lemon juice, fig syrup, and cherry liqueur. Cover and shake until very cold. Strain into a cocktail glass. Garnish with cherries and a lemon twist."
    }
  ],
